<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Monday 117,000-USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Monday 117,000-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Monday's actual interior Iowa/southern Minnesota hog marketings were 117,000 head compared with the estimate of 105,000. Opening trade not well established.  Early sales Barrows and Gilts $0.50-$1.00 per cwt lower than midsession Monday.</p>
